{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person, point-and-click adventure set in a retro-futuristic, post-apocalyptic world where giant insects and abandoned robots reign supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/d68595fcc585507e506ecc69b260fdc6.poster.avif?t=1768382597\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/d68595fcc585507e506ecc69b260fdc6.webm?t=1768382597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/d68595fcc585507e506ecc69b260fdc6.mp4?t=1768382597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to explore and find your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/dedf4b48debb5aea2db7359997ca4c3f.poster.avif?t=1768382597\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/dedf4b48debb5aea2db7359997ca4c3f.webm?t=1768382597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/dedf4b48debb5aea2db7359997ca4c3f.mp4?t=1768382597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Combine specific items to create new ones in your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/58a2e37e0efa61d452c254c741b18c11.poster.avif?t=1768382597\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.