ared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/c20630d0df09fd6ddc16e131c91a789b.webm?t=1768382597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/c20630d0df09fd6ddc16e131c91a789b.mp4?t=1768382597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging narrative that invites you to explore and understand the world's secrets and history, including discovering lore by collecting pages of drawings in a journal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive locations with realistic sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursor animations when hovering over hidden items in the scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking on interactive objects displays a hand-drawn sketch illustrating the expected action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect objects to use later in other scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop items on specific spots to trigger actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic sequences triggered by player actions, advancing the story and unlocking new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine certain objects directly in the inventory to solve puzzles.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301420?t=1768382597","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301420?t=1768382597","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/fcd7d6c0823cab22480f6709badae53656787e05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768382597","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/fcd7d6c0823cab22480f6709badae53656787e05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768382597","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Co